s. To explain their anaphoric uses, typical of 'strong' articles, we propose that the typology is arranged as a cline ordered by entailment, so that stronger articles entail weaker ones.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
